          "quote": "The variables that followed were the applied optimal process parameters: laser power of 1400 W, laser scanning speed of 400 mm/min, gas flow rate of 3 L/min and powder feed rate of 1.4 rad/min. The deposition was performed through bidirectional scanning along the scan direction, resulting in a three-dimensional linear dimension of the fabricated Ni43.9Co22.4Fe8.8Al10.7Ti11.7B2.5 alloy of 50 × 90 × 4 mm",
